    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccb01d853cf3ebc1dda195f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当人们评论伏特加时都只会这么说：\n“她是最帅气的赛马娘。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "73fc9b5336a987089b38aea21993220b2b9996ad7e48b8232b7fbdeca8b07bbb",
